Description: Hakeem: find and fix common problems on HunarOS
 Hakeem (Urdu: healer) checks the internet connection and DNS, interrupted or
 broken package installs, disk space, the clock, failed services, first-boot
 installs, updates, Snap, drivers, sound, Docker access and the local
 development stack, and repairs them with one click. Safe repairs (DNS,
 interrupted installs, a full disk, the clock, Snap) also run by themselves
 once a day. Only a fixed list of repairs can ever run.
